                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237550839",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197963960442",
                            "num_reviews": 35,
                            "playtime_forever": 1309,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1309,
                            "last_played": 1791817395
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really liked the actual card game, and I was excited to be able to play the card game without all the set up and clean up.  However, I have never seen such a blatant cash grab of a game.  You only get the FIRST THREE mission when you buy this game, and then they try and get you to cough up another 5 bucks to buy DLC to play the rest of the locations... I was already put off by the minor bugs (there's some wonkiness occasionally when you stack certain effects that require you to click on invisible cards, etc.. nothing game breaking) and the store that allows you buy things with both in game and actual currency.  This DLC roadblock, however, is an abomination.",
